and periods whose counts are all zero carry nothing about \code{b} and are
dropped first. The Poisson estimate is consistent whatever the
dispersion (Wooldridge 1999); the sandwich and its factor are those of
the least-squares fit, and intervals are normal; \code{rr} is the rate ratio
